  "description": "“Michael, don’t you want to sleep with me?”   \n“…You’re driving me crazy.”\n\nMichael, my childhood friend who has hovered around me, Catherine, since we were young, acting so possessive that I couldn't tell if he was a knight or a bodyguard.\n\nUsing the excuse of my frail health, he wouldn’t let anyone so much as lay a finger on me. I decided to make the most audacious proposal to him.\n\nThe large hands of the man who had always pushed me away began to tremble slightly.\n\nBehind the mask of a 'childhood friend' that had defined his life, a beast-like thirst finally revealed itself.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/297089925)",
